      "body": "<!--e57a25ab6845829454e8d69fc972939a-->\n\nThe following sections might be updated with supplementary metadata relevant to reviewers and maintainers.\n\n<!--006a51241073e994b41acfe9ec718e94-->\n### Code Coverage & Benchmarks\nFor details see: https://corecheck.dev/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36397.\n<!--021abf342d371248e50ceaed478a90ca-->\n### Reviews\nSee [the guideline](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#code-review) and [AI policy](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/blob/master/doc/AI_POLICY.md) for information on the review process.\nA summary of reviews will appear here.\n<!--174a7506f384e20aa4161008e828411d-->\n### Conflicts\nReviewers, this pull request conflicts with the following ones:\n\n* [#bitcoin-core/gui/939](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/gui/pull/939) (gui: show wallet name in progress messages by ShauryaaSharma)\n* [#36326](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36326) (kernel: Use typed errors for fatal and flush error notifications by arejula27)\n* [#36268](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36268) (refactor: prune unused semi-colons by fanquake)\n* [#36031](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36031) (wallet: Remove mapMasterKeys and enforce that only one encryption key can exist by achow101)\n* [#36015](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36015) (txorphanage: bound orphan memory by storing transactions serialized by brunoerg)\n* [#35998](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35998) (wallet: Handle or explicitly ignore `WalletBatch` write failures by achow101)\n* [#35906](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35906) (First steps towards a stateless, side-effect free validation library by purpleKarrot)\n* [#35902](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35902) (zmq: Log bind error at Error level, abort startup on init error by chriszeng1010)\n* [#35763](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35763) (util: write JSON atomically in WriteJson by kevkevinpal)\n* [#35733](https://github.com/bitcoi