      "body": "> 39 conflicts right now. Not sure what number is acceptable, but the focus should probably be to not invalidate any current acks.\r\n\r\nI've wondered this before, but am again wondering if there's a way to have this drahtbot comment also display how many current (full) ACKs are on each of these? IIRC previously I thought it may be a bit tricky/probably not worth it, but with LLMs maybe it might be possible to show?\r\n\r\nI think 39 conflicts is probably a strong enough signal on it's own here, but when there's 5 or 6 it can be useful (but tedious) to click each one and actually see the state of it...",
